---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-brand-orange relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-white/10 -skew-x-12 translate-x-1/2"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6 uppercase tracking-tight">
      Ready to Scale Your Team?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Whether you need niche specialists or a full-scale offshore department, our augmented resourcing models provide the flexibility to grow without limits.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a 
        href="/contact" 
        class="bg-brand-blue text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-md font-bold uppercase text-sm hover:bg-brand-navy transition-all shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
      >
        Contact Us <Icon name="mdi:calendar-check" class="w-5 h-5" />
      </a>
      <!-- 
      <a 
        href="mailto:digiconsultexperts@gmail.com" 
        class="bg-white text-brand-orange px-10 py-4 rounded-md font-bold uppercase text-sm hover:bg-brand-gray-light transition-all shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
      >
        Email Us <Icon name="mdi:email-outline" class="w-5 h-5" />
      </a>
      -->
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-white/70 text-xs italic">
      All engagements commence with clearly defined and transparent terms and conditions.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>